        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "Mr. Carter (TX) moved that the committee rise.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "15:21:47",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 1275, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Mast amendment No. 23.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "15:17:44",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 1275, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Correa amendment No. 10.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "15:09:16",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 1275, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 20 minutes of debate on the Carter (TX) amendment en bloc.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "14:32:41",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - The Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of general debate on H.R. 8469.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H32400",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "14:32:01",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Randy Fine to act as Chairman of the Committee.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H32020",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "14:32:00",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 1275 and Rule XVIII.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "14:31:28",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, H. Con. Res. 96 and H.R. 8469. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, and H.Con.Res. 96 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8469 under a structured rule. The resolution makes in order one motion to recommit on each bill.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H30000",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-14",
        "actionTime": "14:31:23",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1275. (consideration: CR H3486-3505; text: CR H3490-3500)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H1L220",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-13",
        "actionTime": "15:28:45",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "Rule H. Res. 1275 passed House.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H1L210",
        "actionDate": "2026-05-12",
        "actionTime": "19:51:11",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1275 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, H. Con. Res. 96 and H.R. 8469. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, and H.Con.Res. 96 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8469 under a structured rule. The resolution makes in order one motion to recommit on each bill.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
